ukeru","title":"続ける : poursuivre une activité","domain":"grammar","level":"N3","levelBasis":"Editorial difficulty estimate; not an official JLPT item assignment","taxonomy":"verb-compounds","aliases":["tsuzukeru","続ける"],"explanationFr":"Le verbe autonome 続く est intransitif et 続ける transitif. En composition, base de ます + 続ける décrit une action ou un phénomène qui se prolonge, y compris involontairement. Ne pas opposer ces composés sur la seule volonté du sujet.","contrastFr":"Les verbes autonomes 続く et 続ける et leurs composés ne se distinguent pas uniquement par le caractère volontaire de l’action.","examples":[{"ja":"毎日、日本語を学び続けています。","reading":"まいにち、にほんごをまなびつづけています。","fr":"Je continue à apprendre le japonais chaque jour.","origin":"Original example, independent native review pending"},{"ja":"彼は一時間話し続けました。","reading":"かれはいちじかんはなしつづけました。","fr":"Il a parlé sans interruption pendant une heure.","origin":"Original example, independent native review pending"},{"ja":"雨が降り続けています。","reading":"あめがふりつづけています。","fr":"La pluie continue de tomber.","origin":"Original example, independent native review pending"}],"prerequisites":["grammar-verb-groups"],"sources":[{"url":"https://imabi.org/the-verbs-%e7%b6%9a%e3%81%8f-%ef%bc%86-%e7%b6%9a%e3%81%91%e3%82%8b/","title":"Continue: ～続ける","publisher":"Seth Coonrod, original IMABI curriculum author","checkedAt":"12 October 2026","availability":"fetched","verification":"Source fetched; pedagogical source alignment reviewed editorially; no native review claimed","license":"Copyright retained by author; no open license verified","reuse":"Original paraphrase and examples; source lessons, recordings and illustrations not reproduced"}],"status":"editorial-draft","reviewScope":"Editorial linguistic review only; native-speaker review and learner testing pending","createdAt":"12 October 2026","learnerState":"not-assessed","oralPromptsFr":["Je continue à apprendre le japonais chaque jour.","Il a parlé sans interruption pendant une heure.","La pluie continue de tomber."],"levelEstimated":true,"origin":"/Users/zenray/.claude/tmp/tmp-zenray-japanese/research/language/LanguageAdvancedRecords.json","corpus":"language","recordShard":35,"revisionDate":"13 October 2026","markdown":"## adv-tsuzukeru : 続ける : poursuivre une activité (13 October 2026)\n\nDomaine : grammar ; niveau : N3 ; statut : editorial-draft. (13 October 2026)\n\nLe verbe autonome 続く est intransitif et 続ける transitif. En composition, base de ます + 続ける décrit une action ou un phénomène qui se prolonge, y compris involontairement. Ne pas opposer ces composés sur la seule volonté du sujet. (13 October 2026)\n\n| Japonais et lecture | Français |\n|---|---|\n| 毎日、日本語を学び続けています。 (まいにち、にほんごをまなびつづけています。) | Je continue à apprendre le japonais chaque jour. (13 October 2026) |\n| 彼は一時間話し続けました。 (かれはいちじかんはなしつづけました。) | Il a parlé sans interruption pendant une heure. (13 October 2026) |\n| 雨が降り続けています。 (あめがふりつづけています。) | La pluie continue de tomber. (13 October 2026) |\n\nPrérequis : grammar-verb-groups. (13 October 2026)\n\n- [Continue: ～続ける](https://imabi.org/the-verbs-%e7%b6%9a%e3%81%8f-%ef%bc%86-%e7%b6%9a%e3%81%91%e3%82%8b/) ; Seth Coonrod, original IMABI curriculum author ; Copyright retained by author; no open license verified ; vérifié : 12 October 2026. (13 October 2026)\n","lessonContentVersion":"1","lessonContentHash":"385e491a6bb474476096d1dfd7222fe40067337496eaa7afc16653ebe784b32b","lessonValidation":{"status":"approved","contentVersion":"1","contentHash":"385e491a6bb474476096d1dfd7222fe40067337496eaa7afc16653ebe784b32b","reviewerIds":["/root/language_review_a","/root/language_review_b"],"evidenceUrls":["https://imabi.org/the-verbs-%e7%b6%9a%e3%81%8f-%ef%bc%86-%e7%b6%9a%e3%81%91%e3%82%8b/"],"unresolvedFindings":[],"reviewedAtByReviewer":{"/root/language_review_a":null,"/root/language_review_b":"13 October 2026"},"reviewType":"independent-adversarial-model-review","humanReview":false}},{"id":"adv-nakerebanaranai","title":"なければならない : une obligation","domain":"gramm